<div class="ledger-title">Ringkasan Buku Kas</div><div class="summary"><div class="metric"><div class="label">Saldo Buku</div><div class="value">Rp {{ number_format($summary['expected_cash'],0,',','.') }}</div></div><div class="metric"><div class="label">Opening Cash</div><div class="value">Rp {{ number_format($summary['opening_cash'],0,',','.') }}</div></div><div class="metric"><div class="label">Cash In</div><div class="value">Rp {{ number_format($summary['cash_in'],0,',','.') }}</div></div><div class="metric"><div class="label">Cash Out</div><div class="value">Rp {{ number_format($summary['cash_out'],0,',','.') }}</div></div><div class="metric"><div class="label">Gantungan</div><div class="value">Rp {{ number_format($summary['hanging_amount'],0,',','.') }}</div></div><div class="metric"><div class="label">Status Closing</div><div class="value" style="font-size:14px">@if($latestClosing)<span class="closing-badge {{ $latestClosing->status === 'CLOSED' ? 'closed' : 'open' }}">{{ $latestClosing->status }}</span>@else<span class="closing-badge open">BELUM CLOSING</span>@endif</div></div></div>
<div class="book-note">Saldo Buku adalah saldo ERP dari Opening Cash + seluruh mutasi Kas IDR sampai tanggal yang dipilih. Closing Rp tidak membuat mutasi kas baru; Closing hanya merekonsiliasi saldo buku dengan uang fisik + Gantungan.</div>
<div class="section"><div class="ledger-title">Mutasi Buku Kas — {{ $date }}</div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Waktu</th><th>No. Mutasi</th><th>Referensi</th><th>Keterangan</th><th class="num">Masuk</th><th class="num">Keluar</th><th class="num">Saldo Berjalan</th></tr></thead><tbody>@php $running=(float)$summary['opening_cash']; @endphp @forelse($movements as $m) @php $in=strtoupper($m->direction)==='IN'?(float)$m->amount:0; $out=strtoupper($m->direction)==='OUT'?(float)$m->amount:0; $running += $in-$out; @endphp<tr><td>{{ $m->posted_at?->format('H:i:s') }}</td><td>{{ $m->movement_no }}</td><td>{{ $m->reference_type ?: '-' }}{{ $m->reference_id ? ' #'.$m->reference_id : '' }}</td><td>{{ $m->description ?: '-' }}</td><td class="num">{{ $in ? 'Rp '.number_format($in,0,',','.') : '-' }}</td><td class="num">{{ $out ? 'Rp '.number_format($out,0,',','.') : '-' }}</td><td class="num">Rp {{ number_format($running,0,',','.') }}</td></tr>@empty<tr><td colspan="7" style="text-align:center;color:#69727d;padding:14px">Belum ada mutasi kas pada tanggal ini.</td></tr>@endforelse</tbody></table></div></div>
